# Large media / archives
website/*.zip
website/*.mp4

# Security audits — findings name live vulnerabilities, hosts and exposed
# credentials, so they must not enter git history (which has leaked before).
# Glob, not one filename: each audit is dated and the next one must not have
# to remember this rule.
SECURITY_AUDIT*.md
**/SECURITY_AUDIT*.md
PERFORMANCE_REPORT.md
